 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, refer to the figure shown.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/2a5ac0b28dabaf44.png\" alt=\"Four graphs. Graph M has 5 vertices: p, q, t, u, and r. The edges are q t, p u, and u r. Graph W has 11 vertices: a to k. the edges are a e, a f, a b, b g, b h, b c, c i, c d, c k, a j, and j k. Graph R has 7 vertices: a, b, c, d, e, f, and h. The curved edges are a b, b c, c d, d e, and e f. A straight edge connects b and h. Graph X has 10 vertices: a to j. The edges are b a, b c, b d, b i, b f, i e, i g, i h, and i j.\">\n\n",
